1
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:04,230
[Hotel PAL]

2
00:00:07,950 --> 00:00:11,000
Haru, I...

3
00:00:17,190 --> 00:00:18,840
I'm sorry.

4
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:25,270
I got ahead of myself.

5
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:29,650
A weird switch flipped in me.

6
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:32,440
I can't believe I was so giddy about this.

7
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:36,670
I'm so sorry I led you on.

8
00:00:36,670 --> 00:00:40,040
Please, don't apologize.

9
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:47,020
I was waiting for that switch to flip.

10
00:00:50,030 --> 00:00:53,560
You only ever saw me as a coworker.

11
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:57,910
But to me, you were special.

12
00:00:57,910 --> 00:01:01,620
And then you suddenly got married.

13
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:08,010
Truthfully, part of me always hoped
a day like this would come.

14
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:12,000
I'm sorry I took advantage
of your momentary hesitation.

15
00:01:15,040 --> 00:01:23,210
You're a creator I respect, Shibuya.
That hasn't ever changed.

16
00:01:27,310 --> 00:01:30,380
Good luck writing those extra 100 pages.

17
00:01:30,380 --> 00:01:32,730
Is now really the time?

18
00:01:45,960 --> 00:01:47,700
<i>Just got back to my hotel.</i>

19
00:01:47,700 --> 00:01:49,710
<i>Our boys' trip is going great.</i>

20
00:01:49,710 --> 00:01:52,000
<i>Hope you had a good day.</i>

21
00:01:54,950 --> 00:01:58,360
What am I doing?

22
00:02:54,590 --> 00:02:58,640
[Episode 11]

23
00:02:59,850 --> 00:03:05,270
You almost had sex with a coworker?

24
00:03:05,270 --> 00:03:07,000
You, Haru?

25
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:09,090
The late blooming stalker?

26
00:03:09,090 --> 00:03:11,330
Don't poke at my dark past.

27
00:03:11,330 --> 00:03:14,080
I'm just impressed by the evolution.

28
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:18,150
- Have I really "evolved"?
- Huh?

29
00:03:18,150 --> 00:03:21,320
I went from fussy-stalker, to wife.

30
00:03:21,320 --> 00:03:23,900
From pent up, to relieved.

31
00:03:23,900 --> 00:03:28,010
And as a result, I got way ahead of myself.

32
00:03:28,010 --> 00:03:33,800
When you put it that way,
it sounds more like you regressed.

33
00:03:34,470 --> 00:03:40,180
Before, you were more earnest about Ouji.

34
00:03:40,180 --> 00:03:42,520
You think so, too?

35
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:45,100
It's tough, isn't it?

36
00:03:45,100 --> 00:03:51,750
Even when you're honest with yourself,
you don't know what's right.

37
00:03:51,750 --> 00:03:55,130
You lose sight of what's important.

38
00:03:55,790 --> 00:03:58,050
And ultimately, you spiral all over again.

39
00:04:00,310 --> 00:04:02,120
Ugh.

40
00:04:03,740 --> 00:04:06,940
- I wanna disappear.
- Huh?

41
00:04:06,940 --> 00:04:09,240
I couldn't hold myself back.

42
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:11,810
I said something super clingy to Naoki.

43
00:04:11,810 --> 00:04:13,870
You did?

44
00:04:13,870 --> 00:04:19,940
I thought I'd never understand people
who were swayed by love.

45
00:04:19,940 --> 00:04:23,020
But at this rate, he'll only hate me.

46
00:04:24,020 --> 00:04:30,140
I'm scared. I don't want him to hate me.

47
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:33,910
It's like...

48
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:40,210
It's like I'm losing myself.

49
00:04:40,860 --> 00:04:42,860
It hurts.

50
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:47,190
Of course you're scared.

51
00:04:49,860 --> 00:04:53,590
I was, too.

52
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:59,210
I didn't want Ouji to hate me.

53
00:04:59,210 --> 00:05:03,670
So I thought I'd keep everything to myself.

54
00:05:03,670 --> 00:05:06,190
But that was difficult.

55
00:05:06,190 --> 00:05:09,850
Eventually, I exploded.

56
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:18,010
Maybe that's why I regressed at all.

57
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:25,300
It did make me feel a bit better, though.

58
00:05:27,790 --> 00:05:30,820
Except, now I'm more confused.

59
00:05:30,820 --> 00:05:33,680
Maybe I'm not as earnest anymore.

60
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:39,360
And I don't exactly know
what I want in my future, but...

61
00:05:44,250 --> 00:05:46,500
I'm chugging this.

62
00:05:52,330 --> 00:05:54,020
I...

63
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:57,420
I'm going to go confess, right now.

64
00:05:57,420 --> 00:05:58,640
- Huh?
- What?

65
00:05:58,640 --> 00:06:01,120
It's something I need to do,
so I don't lose myself.

66
00:06:01,780 --> 00:06:07,620
I want his body and heart to be all mine.

67
00:06:16,950 --> 00:06:21,150
Watching this is even more nerve-wracking...

68
00:06:22,810 --> 00:06:24,940
He's here.

69
00:06:24,940 --> 00:06:26,680
Akina!

70
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:33,400
Long time no see. Thanks for calling me.

71
00:06:33,400 --> 00:06:36,150
No, thank you for coming on short notice.

72
00:06:36,150 --> 00:06:37,650
It's no problem.

73
00:06:39,710 --> 00:06:44,170
I'm sorry for the other night.

74
00:06:44,170 --> 00:06:46,900
I know it must've been awkward.

75
00:06:46,900 --> 00:06:48,880
I got so depressed on you.

76
00:06:49,620 --> 00:06:51,860
You must think I'm crazy, right?

77
00:06:53,740 --> 00:06:57,520
With the amount of intimacy
we've experienced,

78
00:06:57,520 --> 00:07:01,960
it's only natural to want more.

79
00:07:03,880 --> 00:07:05,390
But...

80
00:07:07,620 --> 00:07:11,770
It's against the business contract, right?

81
00:07:12,880 --> 00:07:14,330
Sorry.

82
00:07:17,220 --> 00:07:19,020
Naoki.

83
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:23,640
I'm sure you can already tell, but...

84
00:07:27,750 --> 00:07:29,630
I...

85
00:07:32,060 --> 00:07:34,470
I love you.

86
00:07:36,760 --> 00:07:41,590
I've never loved another person before.

87
00:07:43,700 --> 00:07:46,840
I've never felt so obsessed.

88
00:07:51,100 --> 00:07:53,080
I've never felt so jealous.

89
00:07:58,740 --> 00:08:01,950
It all makes me hate myself.

90
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:05,910
But...

91
00:08:07,430 --> 00:08:09,200
Right now...

92
00:08:14,340 --> 00:08:16,980
I'm just glad you're here.

93
00:08:23,540 --> 00:08:25,240
Thank you.

94
00:08:30,130 --> 00:08:33,000
I also love you, Akina.

95
00:08:36,740 --> 00:08:40,370
But I have to be honest.

96
00:08:42,030 --> 00:08:44,370
I'm polyamorous.

97
00:08:44,370 --> 00:08:46,610
Polyamorous?

98
00:08:46,610 --> 00:08:52,300
I've always felt obliged to reply
to anyone who's showed me love.

99
00:08:54,420 --> 00:08:56,620
No matter how many partners I may have.

100
00:08:58,220 --> 00:09:01,800
It's hurt many people I've come to know.

101
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:08,360
I apologize for causing you such pain.

102
00:09:13,500 --> 00:09:15,750
I love you.

103
00:09:17,560 --> 00:09:19,700
I love you.

104
00:09:19,700 --> 00:09:21,410
It doesn't hurt.

105
00:09:21,410 --> 00:09:23,290
I love you.

106
00:09:25,790 --> 00:09:27,710
I love you.

107
00:09:29,350 --> 00:09:30,900
I love you.

108
00:09:30,900 --> 00:09:32,810
I love you.

109
00:09:32,810 --> 00:09:34,750
I love you.

110
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:32,210
Drinking the night away
while I put our daughter to bed, huh?

111
00:10:33,550 --> 00:10:35,340
Toshiki.

112
00:10:39,380 --> 00:10:41,550
We need to talk.

113
00:11:15,070 --> 00:11:16,640
What's up?

114
00:11:18,090 --> 00:11:20,590
I was reminiscing.

115
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:23,320
About what?

116
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:27,130
About when we first met.

117
00:11:27,130 --> 00:11:29,970
Even though our feelings were mutual,

118
00:11:29,970 --> 00:11:35,960
you were always especially considerate of me.

119
00:11:43,580 --> 00:11:51,090
Because sex chose to give me another chance,

120
00:11:51,090 --> 00:11:55,280
I felt like I had to take that opportunity
while I could.

121
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:57,080
Really?

122
00:11:57,080 --> 00:12:01,770
Shota.

123
00:12:03,640 --> 00:12:07,090
You taught me to treasure myself.

124
00:12:07,090 --> 00:12:08,940
Thank you.

125
00:12:11,590 --> 00:12:19,690
You've changed me for the better, too.

126
00:12:20,900 --> 00:12:24,720
I'm counting on you for my next shoot, okay?

127
00:12:27,350 --> 00:12:29,990
Don't worry, I'll do my job.

128
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:32,470
But...

129
00:12:37,350 --> 00:12:39,710
This has to end.

130
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:49,070
"Just as life has no happy ending,"

131
00:12:49,070 --> 00:12:55,240
"the explorations of love and sex
do not last forever."

132
00:12:57,960 --> 00:12:59,580
What do you think?

133
00:12:59,580 --> 00:13:05,210
It's as though you're denouncing
the sexual adventure

134
00:13:05,210 --> 00:13:07,700
your protagonist had in the main story.

135
00:13:07,700 --> 00:13:11,730
That wasn't my intent.
She's just faced with reality.

136
00:13:11,730 --> 00:13:13,330
Reality?

137
00:13:13,330 --> 00:13:17,660
After witnessing the outcome
of her friends' journeys,

138
00:13:17,660 --> 00:13:20,460
she once again considers
how she wants her story to end.

139
00:13:20,460 --> 00:13:22,450
How indecisive.

140
00:13:22,450 --> 00:13:26,870
It feels perfectly in character
for this protagonist.

141
00:13:26,870 --> 00:13:28,740
You may be right.

142
00:13:28,740 --> 00:13:31,550
Okay, finish this draft to its end.

143
00:13:31,550 --> 00:13:33,690
Yes, ma'am.

144
00:13:33,690 --> 00:13:35,720
Let's wrap it up early.

145
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:38,690
You're going to the Suffragette's
reunion concert, right?

146
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:41,790
Yes.

147
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:52,420
Are you still undecided?

148
00:13:53,150 --> 00:13:55,950
- Huh?
- About attending.

149
00:13:57,740 --> 00:14:01,980
No. I'm going.

150
00:14:01,980 --> 00:14:04,180
How could I not?

151
00:14:06,020 --> 00:14:07,950
If you're so unsure,

152
00:14:08,750 --> 00:14:10,840
why not stay here, with me?

153
00:14:11,900 --> 00:14:15,430
- Huh?
- The exploration of love and sex.

154
00:14:17,190 --> 00:14:19,810
It doesn't last forever, right?

155
00:14:21,720 --> 00:14:22,850
Well...

156
00:14:22,850 --> 00:14:26,650
You may fall out of love
with your husband one day, too.

157
00:14:28,150 --> 00:14:30,010
So why not end it here,

158
00:14:31,140 --> 00:14:33,870
and start a new journey, with me?

159
00:14:37,900 --> 00:14:39,680
I...

160
00:14:42,170 --> 00:14:44,600
Do you not want it to end?

161
00:14:55,950 --> 00:14:59,800
<i>I love you, Haru.</i>

162
00:15:06,900 --> 00:15:09,070
No, I don't.

163
00:15:13,580 --> 00:15:16,540
Despite everything...

164
00:15:17,330 --> 00:15:21,420
I love Ouji.

165
00:15:22,680 --> 00:15:24,570
I'm sorry.

166
00:15:28,030 --> 00:15:29,880
I knew that already.

167
00:15:32,040 --> 00:15:33,720
Huh?

168
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:38,010
You're the only one who doesn't.

169
00:15:45,450 --> 00:15:47,210
Thank you.

170
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:52,430
Enjoy the concert.

171
00:15:53,940 --> 00:15:55,780
I will.

172
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:10,020
I always... always knew.

173
00:16:13,910 --> 00:16:19,020
<i>Why? Since when had I become so confused?</i>

174
00:16:20,510 --> 00:16:26,020
<i>My feelings for him have never changed.</i>

175
00:16:26,890 --> 00:16:29,840
<i>Not since the day we first met.</i>

176
00:16:32,050 --> 00:16:35,660
<i>It's so easy. Ouji, I...</i>

177
00:16:46,980 --> 00:16:48,730
[Suffragette City - REBIRTH, 2026]

178
00:16:53,560 --> 00:16:55,640
Aizawa?

179
00:16:57,310 --> 00:17:00,020
Right, of course you'd come watch.

180
00:17:00,020 --> 00:17:02,400
It's their reunion concert.

181
00:17:02,400 --> 00:17:07,520
This is your first time attending a concert
as Ouji's wife, right?

182
00:17:08,190 --> 00:17:09,980
Congrats.

183
00:17:18,740 --> 00:17:20,840
Can we talk?

184
00:17:22,110 --> 00:17:24,420
[Secrets]

185
00:17:25,530 --> 00:17:26,950
We're almost up.

186
00:17:26,950 --> 00:17:28,940
Is Haru coming?

187
00:17:28,940 --> 00:17:32,860
Yeah. She never mentioned when, though.

188
00:17:32,860 --> 00:17:34,800
Hope she makes it in time.

189
00:17:35,780 --> 00:17:37,110
Yeah.

190
00:17:38,450 --> 00:17:41,780
Please, explain. What is going on here?

191
00:17:43,220 --> 00:17:45,230
Well...

192
00:17:46,150 --> 00:17:48,340
What did Ouji say?

193
00:17:49,730 --> 00:17:53,870
My husband said nothing.

194
00:17:53,870 --> 00:17:55,770
Excuse me?

195
00:17:55,770 --> 00:17:59,380
That good-for-nothing wimp.

196
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:06,080
I admit, I wanted to ruffle your feathers.

197
00:18:06,080 --> 00:18:07,010
What?

198
00:18:07,010 --> 00:18:12,980
But I only wanted to add a bit of spice.
Like a good curry.

199
00:18:12,980 --> 00:18:15,940
Then, this was...

200
00:18:15,940 --> 00:18:17,700
What do you think happened?

201
00:18:18,330 --> 00:18:22,240
What would you do if he had cheated on you?

202
00:18:27,500 --> 00:18:29,380
I wouldn't have done a thing.

203
00:18:30,040 --> 00:18:33,470
Marriage doesn't make him my property.

204
00:18:34,470 --> 00:18:38,870
I only wished to know the truth.

205
00:18:43,740 --> 00:18:48,230
You've changed.

206
00:18:50,120 --> 00:18:54,010
Of course we didn't do anything!
Not like we ever could.

207
00:18:54,010 --> 00:18:55,370
- Huh?
- You already know, right?

208
00:18:55,370 --> 00:19:00,800
I told him marriage wouldn't work
if he continued to hide his ED.

209
00:19:00,800 --> 00:19:03,880
And just when I thought
we'd have a thrilling reunion,

210
00:19:03,880 --> 00:19:09,420
he goes on and on
about his newlywed life and sex woes.

211
00:19:09,420 --> 00:19:13,460
I don't know how to treat a girl
who used to be a fan.

212
00:19:13,460 --> 00:19:18,340
But I can tell it's been rough on her.

213
00:19:20,340 --> 00:19:23,970
Ouji went to you for advice...

214
00:19:24,630 --> 00:19:25,850
About me?

215
00:19:25,850 --> 00:19:28,530
He was seriously so annoying.

216
00:19:28,530 --> 00:19:33,110
But I enjoyed the thrill
of not being a mother for once.

217
00:19:33,110 --> 00:19:36,930
Can you blame me for being a little mean?

218
00:19:37,550 --> 00:19:39,740
The concert is about to begin.

219
00:19:39,740 --> 00:19:42,370
Thank you. We'll be right there.

220
00:20:06,860 --> 00:20:12,520
♪ <i>Embracing warm moments together</i> ♪

221
00:20:12,520 --> 00:20:19,860
♪ <i>Your laugh is beautiful, yet sorrowful</i> ♪

222
00:20:19,860 --> 00:20:25,570
♪ <i>The thoughtless words I spill</i> ♪

223
00:20:25,570 --> 00:20:32,040
♪ <i>Make your tears bitter, yet sweet</i> ♪

224
00:20:32,040 --> 00:20:38,490
♪ <i>Why is it I long for your profile?</i> ♪

225
00:20:38,490 --> 00:20:44,990
♪ <i>Why is it I chase your fading shadow?</i> ♪

226
00:20:44,990 --> 00:20:51,500
♪ <i>Why is it? Why can't I smile?</i> ♪

227
00:20:51,500 --> 00:20:57,130
♪ <i>I always knew I was a lame guy</i> ♪

228
00:20:57,130 --> 00:21:04,060
♪ <i>I had nothing to offer,
yet you stayed at my side</i> ♪

229
00:21:04,060 --> 00:21:12,090
♪ <i>Because we called that happiness</i> ♪

230
00:21:12,090 --> 00:21:17,050
♪ <i>A gift you bestowed to me</i> ♪

231
00:21:17,050 --> 00:21:29,160
♪ <i>I love you, I love you so</i> ♪

232
00:21:29,160 --> 00:21:36,030
♪ <i>I always knew I do</i> ♪

233
00:21:57,270 --> 00:21:58,780
Haru.

234
00:22:04,660 --> 00:22:07,040
Weren't you in the middle of an after-party?

235
00:22:07,040 --> 00:22:11,000
It's fine. I've raised a toast with the guys.

236
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:13,030
The party will last all night anyway.

237
00:22:13,030 --> 00:22:15,680
So? How was the concert?

238
00:22:16,380 --> 00:22:18,420
It was amazing.

239
00:22:18,420 --> 00:22:21,240
I liked your new song, too. It felt sincere.

240
00:22:21,240 --> 00:22:25,030
Seriously? Your compliment
means the most to me.

241
00:22:25,030 --> 00:22:26,220
Huh?

242
00:22:26,220 --> 00:22:29,900
You're an old, dedicated fan.

243
00:22:29,900 --> 00:22:32,890
Of course I'd want to hear your thoughts.

244
00:22:32,890 --> 00:22:35,180
I'm glad you liked it.

245
00:22:42,940 --> 00:22:45,260
I'm a long-time fan.

246
00:22:46,020 --> 00:22:48,940
You're always within arm's reach.

247
00:22:50,610 --> 00:22:53,820
I'm allowed to monopolize your smiles.

248
00:22:55,300 --> 00:22:59,950
My old self would be so jealous of me now.

249
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:02,490
Except...

250
00:23:06,770 --> 00:23:09,010
Ouji.

251
00:23:10,840 --> 00:23:16,180
I've changed. You've noticed, right?

252
00:23:17,880 --> 00:23:20,410
Yeah. But I'm fine...

253
00:23:20,410 --> 00:23:23,420
I know. I wasn't going to bring it up either.

254
00:23:37,880 --> 00:23:39,430
Ouji.

255
00:23:41,030 --> 00:23:44,010
I had sex with another man.

256
00:23:47,920 --> 00:23:50,850
I have no right to be your wife.

257
00:24:40,940 --> 00:24:48,920
[Preview]
